## Scope

The PM order (02:1x ICT 2026-11-02) says the Workbooks two-model check refused four week 1 rows.
Forge redoes them as new versions (-v2) and sends new file names and a new manifest hash. The
writer (`writeMuseDelivery`) took both delivered names from the list row, so it could not write a
version 2. The new tests T184 to T189 pin the `fileVersion` contract. T152 to T172, T181, and
T182 did not change. T183 stays reserved for the cover calm-top test.

